---
title: Agentic Cycle
id: agentic-cycle
order: 1
description: "The agentic cycle in TanStack AI — how the LLM loops through tool calls, results, and reasoning until it produces a final answer."
keywords:
  - tanstack ai
  - agentic cycle
  - agent loop
  - tool calling
  - multi-step reasoning
  - ai agents
